    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770380/extras/c03e3cd037765e1f30e8488a120bd111.avif?t=1752821835\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770380/extras/4dfdcd715bf0be7a2b8542589cf2928a.avif?t=1752821835\" data-has-big width=800 height=116 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770380/extras/dead1ca988f05aac9a4c64a803d9f2be.avif?t=1752821835\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770380/extras/d539ce3a7d837202c359e450ed40d3d8.avif?t=1752821835\" data-has-big width=800 height=46 /></span>You\u2019ve just purchased an adult product: a &quot;Lovely Doll.&quot;    <br>But somehow, she lives\u2014and she comes with a bizarre feature: the more garbage she eats, the smarter she becomes.    <br>In this visual novel you decide her daily menu, nurture her, and deepen your bond.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770380/extras/a1f61e4c0bf6071f82d0ac994602dcb1.avif?t=1752821835\" data-has-big width=800 height=46 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770380/extras/61951b7c22bc63def986f442b0901694.avif?t=1752821835\" data-has-big width=800 height=351 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Miali \u25c6</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A miraculous life\u2011size doll bought as an adult product.  <br>Eating trash makes her smarter, and her appearance evolves\u2014she\u2019s quite the fashionista!<br><br>\u2026but be careful.<br><br>Her ever-growing intellect reshapes more than her looks\u2014it rewrites everything she is.  <br>Like pup,   <br>like apprentice,  <br>like sidekick,  <br>like confidant,    <br>like lover,    <br>even like monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770380/extras/cafc2218a30d6fda26f88eab4a15fb40.avif?t=1752821835\" data-has-big width=800 height=513 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770380/extras/ecf871cf41dc6527792c0e51711808e8.avif?t=1752821835\" data-has-big width=800 height=46 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770380/extras/3be2625ae4aee92d83922859fbb00e60.avif?t=1752821835\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&gt; \u201cA game about eating trash? Hard pass!\ud83e\udd2e\u201d </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please, don\u2019t give up on us just yet! </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >photo-based stills made from inedible items\u2014shoe soles, rags, wilted bouquets, and more\u2014arranged so cleanly they might even look delicious.   <br>Each plate comes with playful flavor text. Enjoy them together with Miali!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b<i>No actual garbage was eaten during production.</i><br>\u3000<br><i>\u3000</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770380/extras/e3d526746d338d2b6f223f2863b3486f.avif?t=1752821835\" data-has-big width=800 height=46 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple controls, deep drama</strong><br>Branch the story with a single click. Your choices guide Miali\u2019s staged evolution.<br>The overall narrative blends happy, nostalgic, decadent, romantic, and horror tones.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A</strong> <strong>quirky</strong>\u00a0<strong>\u201cMeal Selection\u201d phase</strong><br>Trash or regular food? Your values will be tested.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong><br>Your choices determine how the story concludes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorably irresistible character design &amp; art</strong> <br>Miali\u2019s advanced forms are designed by manga artist <strong>Idaten Funisuke </strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A warm, simple \u201cMiali Theme\u201d is rearranged for every intelligence stage, plus many immersive tracks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_strike\">\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f</span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&lt;Notes&gt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*This visual novel centers on the theme of <strong>increasing intelligence</strong>.</i><br><i>Despite its extreme premise\u2014\u201cLovely Doll \u00d7 Garbage Cuisine\u201d\u2014the narrative is inspired by Daniel Keyes\u2019s classic <strong>Flowers for Algernon</strong>. If depictions of cognition and transformation may cause you discomfort, please proceed with caution.  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*All sexual content is limited to life-size \u201cLovely Dolls,\u201d fictional adult products; no minors are depicted or involved.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*Garbage dishes are <strong>not</strong> edible. The staff did <strong>not</strong> actually eat them. Please do not imitate anything shown in the game.  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*Game content is subject to change without notice.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770380/extras/c03e3cd037765e1f30e8488a120bd111.avif?t=1752821835\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770380/extras/4dfdcd715bf0be7a2b8542589cf2928a.avif?t=1752821835\" data-has-big width=800 height=116 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770380/extras/dead1ca988f05aac9a4c64a803d9f2be.avif?t=1752821835\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770380/extras/d539ce3a7d837202c359e450ed40d3d8.avif?t=1752821835\" data-has-big width=800 height=46 /></span>You\u2019ve just purchased an adult product: a &quot;Lovely Doll.&quot;    <br>But somehow, she lives\u2014and she comes with a bizarre feature: the more garbage she eats, the smarter she becomes.    <br>In this visual novel you decide her daily menu, nurture her, and deepen your bond.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770380/extras/a1f61e4c0bf6071f82d0ac994602dcb1.avif?t=1752821835\" data-has-big width=800 height=46 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770380/extras/61951b7c22bc63def986f442b0901694.avif?t=1752821835\" data-has-big width=800 height=351 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Miali \u25c6</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A miraculous life\u2011size doll bought as an adult product.  <br>Eating trash makes her smarter, and her appearance evolves\u2014she\u2019s qu